{"id":"08bb92b5435e7a5a","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-differentiation.md","title":"Differentiation","display":"df-differentiation — Differentiation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-differentiation","aliases":["58-df-differentiation","Differentiation"],"display":"df-differentiation — Differentiation","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-limit]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-differentiation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-differentiation</span><span>Differentiation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-differentiation — Differentiation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f67456d74b418241\" href=\"?note=f67456d74b418241\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md\">../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"68fb21596025bb57\" href=\"?note=68fb21596025bb57\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-limit\">../batch20/58-df-limit</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^m\\land f:U\\to\\mathbb R^n\">\\(U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^m\\land f:U\\to\\mathbb R^n\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in U\\land h\\in\\mathbb R^m\">\\(x\\in U\\land h\\in\\mathbb R^m\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Linear}_{\\mathbb R}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Linear}_{\\mathbb R}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (linear-map predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f67456d74b418241\" href=\"?note=f67456d74b418241\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md\">../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Differentiable}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Differentiable}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (differentiability predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}differentiation} \\vdash \\mathrm{Differentiable}_S(f,x) \\leftrightarrow U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^m\\land f:U\\to\\mathbb R^n\\land x\\in U\\land\\exists L\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Linear}_{\\mathbb R}(L;\\mathbb R^m,\\mathbb R^n)\\land\\lim_{\\substack{h\\to0\\\\x+h\\in U}}\\frac{\\|f(x+h)-f(x)-L(h)\\|}{\\|h\\|}=0\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}differentiation} \\vdash \\mathrm{Differentiable}_S(f,x) \\leftrightarrow U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^m\\land f:U\\to\\mathbb R^n\\land x\\in U\\land\\exists L\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Linear}_{\\mathbb R}(L;\\mathbb R^m,\\mathbb R^n)\\land\\lim_{\\substack{h\\to0\\\\x+h\\in U}}\\frac{\\|f(x+h)-f(x)-L(h)\\|}{\\|h\\|}=0\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Differentiation: best linear approximation; limit of difference quotient</li>\n<li>Fréchet: norm-independent derivative; infinite-dimensional Banach spaces</li>\n<li>Gateaux: directional derivative; weaker than Fréchet</li>\n<li>Sobolev: weak derivative in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^p\">\\(L^p\\)</span>; extends classical differentiation to distributions</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rudin, Principles of Mathematical Analysis</li>\n<li>Evans, Partial Differential Equations</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"f67456d74b418241","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-limit","status":"resolved","id":"68fb21596025bb57","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-limit]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"f67456d74b418241","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Linear}_{\\mathbb R}\\subseteq V^3$ (linear-map predicate, see [[../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^m\\land f:U\\to\\mathbb R^n","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in U\\land h\\in\\mathbb R^m","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Linear}_{\\mathbb R}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Differentiable}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}differentiation} \\vdash \\mathrm{Differentiable}_S(f,x) \\leftrightarrow U\\subseteq\\mathbb R^m\\land f:U\\to\\mathbb R^n\\land x\\in U\\land\\exists L\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Linear}_{\\mathbb R}(L;\\mathbb R^m,\\mathbb R^n)\\land\\lim_{\\substack{h\\to0\\\\x+h\\in U}}\\frac{\\|f(x+h)-f(x)-L(h)\\|}{\\|h\\|}=0\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"L^p","display":false}],"bytes":1378,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-429","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-differentiation.md|58-df-differentiation]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["f67456d74b418241","68fb21596025bb57"]}